{"3339970":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"WendyQuest: Legend of the Four Corner Stones","steam_appid":3339970,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Available for Steam Deck<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/b0a7352cb62a50e24c28bf00822b44f0.avif?t=1793766979\" width=920 height=284 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/b9d145e571b8c9edc4cafda9da9be564.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/b9d145e571b8c9edc4cafda9da9be564.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">WendyQuest is 100% fresh and 100% human made!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/291b40d2e62c7db72cb27a71c561900a.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/291b40d2e62c7db72cb27a71c561900a.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When mechanized monsters invade a culinary kingdom, it’s up to Wendy to save Savoria from mech-trouble. Welcome to WendyQuest, an epic original adventure where you earn real food as you play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Wendy and battle Mech Corp’s mechs, solve puzzles, and embark on an epic quest to unite four magical stones to save Savoria. Will you restore order to a realm in peril? The fate of flavor is in your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/358915fb8f8350bd46a17de579d7231e.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/358915fb8f8350bd46a17de579d7231e.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/6243b1be10bcbf59376b308695e478f0.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/6243b1be10bcbf59376b308695e478f0.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dr. Mechborg and his mechs have spread a curse called “Mechtosis” across Savoria using soggy fries, frozen beef &amp; other culinary atrocities. Only Wendy - armed with sacred spatulas, fresh beef, and an ancient prophecy - can restore order to Savoria’s people and end the mechademic once and for all.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/0bd7dde5b33acf302b424d4bc7d9b484.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/0bd7dde5b33acf302b424d4bc7d9b484.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/05681e4a4296cfcde54f998f126deaf9.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/05681e4a4296cfcde54f998f126deaf9.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Square off against flavorless foes like Golden Archers, Hot Sludge Sundaes and other fast food fiends in strategic turn-based battles. Time your attacks perfectly to deal supersized damage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.poster.avif?t=1793766979\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.webm?t=1793766979\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.mp4?t=1793766979\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/5057a94e4e953df093625bfe86e540d7.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/5057a94e4e953df093625bfe86e540d7.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span>Team up with tasty pals including a French Fry Archer, Spicy Chickeneer, Frosty Mage, and more. Each ally brings their own flavor to the table that deals extra damage against specific enemy types.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/3852ab9b0484d78979b9f7c059a25570.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/3852ab9b0484d78979b9f7c059a25570.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/6436cbe7a64cae83b305be54e02b37e0.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/6436cbe7a64cae83b305be54e02b37e0.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey across five food-themed regions including salty forests, seasoned deserts, rugged beefy bluffs, and Frosty-capped peaks - each filled with hidden secrets waiting to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/b9d145e571b8c9edc4cafda9da9be564.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/b9d145e571b8c9edc4cafda9da9be564.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">WendyQuest is 100% fresh and 100% human made!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/291b40d2e62c7db72cb27a71c561900a.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/291b40d2e62c7db72cb27a71c561900a.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When mechanized monsters invade a culinary kingdom, it’s up to Wendy to save Savoria from mech-trouble. Welcome to WendyQuest, an epic original adventure where you earn real food as you play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Wendy and battle Mech Corp’s mechs, solve puzzles, and embark on an epic quest to unite four magical stones to save Savoria. Will you restore order to a realm in peril? The fate of flavor is in your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/358915fb8f8350bd46a17de579d7231e.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/358915fb8f8350bd46a17de579d7231e.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/6243b1be10bcbf59376b308695e478f0.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/6243b1be10bcbf59376b308695e478f0.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dr. Mechborg and his mechs have spread a curse called “Mechtosis” across Savoria using soggy fries, frozen beef &amp; other culinary atrocities. Only Wendy - armed with sacred spatulas, fresh beef, and an ancient prophecy - can restore order to Savoria’s people and end the mechademic once and for all.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/0bd7dde5b33acf302b424d4bc7d9b484.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/0bd7dde5b33acf302b424d4bc7d9b484.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/05681e4a4296cfcde54f998f126deaf9.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/05681e4a4296cfcde54f998f126deaf9.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Square off against flavorless foes like Golden Archers, Hot Sludge Sundaes and other fast food fiends in strategic turn-based battles. Time your attacks perfectly to deal supersized damage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.poster.avif?t=1793766979\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.webm?t=1793766979\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/49351abdf0e908de9e3482a4d36ac682.mp4?t=1793766979\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/5057a94e4e953df093625bfe86e540d7.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/5057a94e4e953df093625bfe86e540d7.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span>Team up with tasty pals including a French Fry Archer, Spicy Chickeneer, Frosty Mage, and more. Each ally brings their own flavor to the table that deals extra damage against specific enemy types.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/3852ab9b0484d78979b9f7c059a25570.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/3852ab9b0484d78979b9f7c059a25570.avif?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=624 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras\/6436cbe7a64cae83b305be54e02b37e0.avif?t=1793766979\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/extras_big\/6436cbe7a64cae83b305be54e02b37e0.webp?t=1793766979 width=1560 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey across five food-themed regions including salty forests, seasoned deserts, rugged beefy bluffs, and Frosty-capped peaks - each filled with hidden secrets waiting to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Welcome to WendyQuest - a well-done 2D adventure RPG from Wendy’s packed with crispy combat, handcrafted pixel art, and fresh, never frozen puzzles. Play as redheaded warrior Wendy &amp; battle evil mech-monsters to save a culinary kingdom in peril.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/45188b5febd7dd0c8fc16a35c8f2a7d8ea0a87c1\/header.jpg?t=1793766979","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/a0c43e26a163a38c429367610fdd80235b85c0c1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793766979","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3339970\/a0c43e26a163a38c429367610fdd80235b85c0c1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793766979","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Potato<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Deep Fryer<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Salt<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Ketchup optional<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Baked Potato<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Oven<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Butter<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Sour Cream and Bacon Bits optional<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 Quality Is Our Recipe, LLC","developers":["81monkeys"],"publishers":["81monkeys"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":28,"descriptio